  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.4.3 — Polish trio (performance patch). Diffed column-visibility toggle: hiding/showing a non-frozen column flips `hidden` on its existing cells in place instead of rebuilding thead/tbody/tfoot. Pre-resolved per-column paint pipeline: cell-paint branch (formatter vs converter) is hoisted out of the N×M cell loop into a per-render `paint[]` array, eliminating per-cell branching. Virtual scroll pad-only fast path: when new rows arrive but the visible window's slice is unchanged, only the pad row heights are mutated — data <tr>s keep their identity. No public API additions; bundle ticks to 15.68 KB brotli (+~220 B), still well under the 18 KB ceiling.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Bootstrap 5 data grid (vanilla JS, TypeScript, less than 15 KB gzipped).",
